stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> EvidenceCreated: user selects text / figure / table
    EvidenceCreated --> DraftGenerating: analyze selection or section
    DraftGenerating --> ValidationFailed: schema / anchor / numeric check fails
    ValidationFailed --> DraftGenerating: retry or switch model
    ValidationFailed --> ManualOnly: user continues without AI

    DraftGenerating --> Draft: validated AI proposal
    Draft --> Accepted: user accepts
    Draft --> Edited: user edits and accepts
    Draft --> Rejected: user rejects

    Accepted --> Verified
    Edited --> Verified
    Verified --> Reused: search / synthesis / export / link
    Reused --> Verified

    Verified --> Stale: PDF version, parser or evidence changed
    Stale --> Verified: user revalidates / anchor relocates
    Stale --> Archived: no longer applicable

    Rejected --> [*]
    Archived --> [*]
    ManualOnly --> UserNote
    UserNote --> Verified: user marks structured knowledge
